  "targetAge": 15,
  "scale": "1/72",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『境界戦機 極鋼ノ装鬼』（きょうかいせんき きょっこうのそうき）より、北米同盟軍の最新量産機「アーロンライノ」が登場！",
      "en": "From ``Kyoukai Senki Kyokko no Souki'' comes the North American Alliance Army's latest mass-produced machine ``Aaron Rhino''!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 拡張性を重視しカスタマイズ用の３mm径の接続穴を各所に配置。別売りのウェポンセットシリーズと組み合わせればプラモデルオリジナルアレンジも可能。",
      "en": "• 3mm diameter connection holes are placed in various locations for customization with emphasis on expandability. If you combine it with the separately sold Weapon set series, you can create an original plastic model arrangement."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ナイフ、アサルトライフル、チェーンガンなど多彩な武装を搭載。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a variety of weapons including knives, assault rifles, and chain guns."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脇下にはナイフをマウント可能。",
      "en": "• A knife can be mounted under the armpit."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部パーツの差し替えで「戦闘モード」と「索敵モード」を再現可能。",
      "en": "• \"Battle mode \" and \" enemy search mode\" can be reproduced by replacing the head parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの「HG 1/72 V-33 ストークキャリー」と組み合わせて輸送状態を再現可能。",
      "en": "• Transport conditions can be reproduced by combining with the separately sold \"HG 1/72 V-33 Stalk Carry\"."
    }
  ],
